<title>singapore: Singapore bunker final report and prices - Jan 9.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - Jan 9.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   113/115   120/122     UNQ     234/236</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  120/122   125/128   238/242   248/255</p>
<p>-------- COMMENTS -  Bunker eased on Thursday on thin</p>
<p>demand, with most shipowners confident that prices would slip further, traders said. A major said due to poor bunker demand, some traders were cornered to dispose of their cargoes in the cargo market, This placed more pressure on the cargo market.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3082)</p>
